📋 Response Playbook
First 60 Minutes
Critical Actions
Declare incident severity.
Establish emergency communication channels.
Isolate FIN-PC07.
Restrict FS01 network access.
Secure backup systems.
Revoke suspicious account sessions.
Notify leadership and external responders.
