🔍 Digital Forensics & Evidence Preservation

The plan includes a structured evidence management process.

Evidence Sources
Forensic images of affected endpoints
Email attachments and headers
Microsoft 365 audit logs
Authentication records
Firewall, DNS, and proxy logs
Ransom notes
Backup system audit records
Chain of Custody

For every evidence item:

Unique evidence ID assigned
Collection method documented
Collection timestamps recorded
Integrity hashes calculated
Access logged and restricted

This ensures forensic admissibility and investigative reliability.

