Enhance examination continuity procedures.

🏆 Key Lessons Learned

The most important lesson from the exercise is that operational urgency should never override security validation. Restoring services from unverified backups introduces significant risk and may worsen an incident.

Additional lessons include:

Backup success messages do not guarantee recoverability.
Cloud identity systems require equal attention during ransomware investigations.
Evidence preservation must occur alongside containment.
Communication should clearly distinguish facts from assumptions.
Regular testing is essential for recovery confidence.
